    },
    "body": "The completed coupled learner remains 9/15 conditional. This saved-data diagnosis identifies which errors were never solved by any recorded alternative and which EOS fixes were rejected, without repeating model execution or learning.\n\nAll 391 native snapshots and 14292 previously audited alternatives are covered. Five residual positions never win; EOS wins33 times, with26 strict-CE failures and7 first original-guard299 vetoes. No feasible recorded alternative exceeds9/15. The report separates base Generate from frozen U and full Copy/Generate competition and does not infer global capacity from distinct states/keys.\n\nThe existing frozen ordered Generate pair path is the next saved incidence/constraint-sharing discriminator. No fresh learning is admitted; full source-bound preflight conditions and limitations are recorded. Existing source-only engineering review corrected U attribution, native denominator comparison and Rust report boundaries. Final analysis took17.6585 seconds with295880KiB peak RSS and passed pinned Rust claim/seal/complete-file verification. Failed analysis attempts are retained as tool defects. The final executed analyzer hash matches the committed source; archive member SHA, exact sealed set, claim-wording and diff checks pass. No Rust model source changed, so no model rebuild or experiment was repeated.\n\nAll ten new pod files are preserved in the small archive with complete remote-member SHA comparison. The previously preserved large inputs remain at #2023's pinned private-store revisions. Codex released its lease; live status showed DeepSeek actively using the shared pod, so it was not removed. After actual protected merge, verify delivered blobs on fresh main and manually delete the remote/local branch and owned worktree.\n\nReferences #820. Exact reviewed delivery head: `9ccb561a9a8304da99f5ba941fdcbc57c590c94d`.",
